  "content": "\n\n<h1>華麗門動畫</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gQIpdGQl/images/554da7a7dabbceadbfab61af5ecec6b454daba7d.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fgQIpdGQl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/gQIpdGQl?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-door-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1357699?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&labelColor=16181c&color=34363c\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fP7dR8mSH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric%20API-Required-34363c?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod%20Menu-Optional-34363c?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"選填 Mod Menu\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Cloth%20Config-Optional-34363c?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=16181c\" alt=\"選填 Cloth Config\"></a></p>\n<p>為原版門提供流暢的客戶端動畫。多人遊戲相容、資源包友好，設計上即與 Sodium 和 Iris 兼容。</p>\n<h2>功能說明</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>為原版門與陷阱門加入流暢的開關動畫</li>\n<li>可由任何來源觸發：玩家、紅石、生物或網路事件</li>\n<li>純客戶端模組，無需安裝伺服器端</li>\n<li>完美適配所有資源包與現有模型</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ 陰影提示：根據所使用的陰影包，您在開關門時可能會注意到光照閃爍。這是陰影端的限制，並非模組本身的問題。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>ℹ️ 紋理跳動提示：您可能會在動畫結束時注意到短暫的紋理不一致。這是因為原版 Minecraft 的紋理本身不夠一致所致，並非此模組的錯誤。您可以使用如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcreaky-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creaky Doors</a> 的資源包來修復此問題。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>開發路線圖</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>同時開啟雙扇門</li>\n<li>設定選項</li>\n<li>開放原始碼</li>\n</ul>",
